cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "dbd2netcdf: Convert Slocum glider Dinkum Binary Data files to NetCDF and CSV"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tools for translating the Dinkum Binary Data (DBD) files produced
  by Teledyne Webb Research Slocum gliders into NetCDF or CSV. Handles the full
  DBD family (dbd/ebd/sbd/tbd/mbd) together with their LZ4-compressed *.?c?
  variants, and shares a sensor cache across files so multi-file deployments
  convert in a single pass.
type: software
authors:
